(41611, 416, 'Thank you. I will check the requirements.', 'Cảm ơn. Tôi sẽ kiểm tra yêu cầu.', '/θæŋk ju. aɪ wɪl ʧɛk ðə rɪkˈwaɪrmənts/', '', 'PRACTICE_SENTENCE'),
