(42311, 423, 'Understood. I will share the results with you.', 'Tôi hiểu. Tôi sẽ chia sẻ kết quả.', '/ˌəndərˈstʊd. aɪ wɪl ʃɛr ðə rɪˈzəlts wɪθ ju/', '', 'PRACTICE_SENTENCE'),
